       <string>Runs scan -&gt; corrected projections -&gt; sinograms -&gt; reconstruction as one continuous in-memory pass, without writing corr/ or sino/ to disk - for large-RAM machines where that disk round-trip is pure overhead. reco/ is still written as usual. Requires Start From = Raw scan or Corrected projections (there's nothing on disk to resume from otherwise).</string>
      </property>
      <property name="text">
       <string>Run In-Memory</string>
      </property>
